@host = http://localhost:8083

### Requires existing ETL data for user 123
GET {{host}}/twitter?user_id=123&type=both&phrase=hello&hashtag=cloud

### Reply contacts only
GET {{host}}/twitter?user_id=123&type=reply&phrase=hello&hashtag=cloud

### Retweet contacts only
GET {{host}}/twitter?user_id=123&type=retweet&phrase=hello&hashtag=cloud

### Invalid type returns the team header followed by INVALID
GET {{host}}/twitter?user_id=123&type=unknown&phrase=hello&hashtag=cloud
